    "detailed_description": "<strong>-Travel to a beautiful island</strong><br>Immerse yourself in the sounds and colours of a small Sicilian town, a carefully crafted and hand-painted setting and characters <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/aa90a0e6a15456a322aaa0c5961d6b47.poster.avif?t=1675241551\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/aa90a0e6a15456a322aaa0c5961d6b47.webm?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/aa90a0e6a15456a322aaa0c5961d6b47.mp4?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>- A story of revolt against Mafia oppression</strong><br>Become a protagonist in an engaging story of struggle against the injustices of the underworld, help the animal citizens to redeem their rights and their territory. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/eb8307fc613e941bc81127f794db13e6.poster.avif?t=1675241551\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/eb8307fc613e941bc81127f794db13e6.webm?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/eb8307fc613e941bc81127f794db13e6.mp4?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>- Choose which cards to play!</strong>- <br>Defeat the mafia by choosing the cards in your deck, you must be careful: not all cards bring positive results<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/392b2abfdfa9c647633a3031b59389c8.poster.avif?t=1675241551\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/392b2abfdfa9c647633a3031b59389c8.webm?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/392b2abfdfa9c647633a3031b59389c8.mp4?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>- Sensational visual effects </strong><br>Every time you play your card, you activate its effect: energy bombs, storms, music and much more...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/697858a317556bf6ea838b6368c6e84e.poster.avif?t=1675241551\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/697858a317556bf6ea838b6368c6e84e.webm?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/697858a317556bf6ea838b6368c6e84e.mp4?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>-Travel to a beautiful island</strong><br>Immerse yourself in the sounds and colours of a small Sicilian town, a carefully crafted and hand-painted setting and characters <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/aa90a0e6a15456a322aaa0c5961d6b47.poster.avif?t=1675241551\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/aa90a0e6a15456a322aaa0c5961d6b47.webm?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/aa90a0e6a15456a322aaa0c5961d6b47.mp4?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>- A story of revolt against Mafia oppression</strong><br>Become a protagonist in an engaging story of struggle against the injustices of the underworld, help the animal citizens to redeem their rights and their territory. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/eb8307fc613e941bc81127f794db13e6.poster.avif?t=1675241551\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/eb8307fc613e941bc81127f794db13e6.webm?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/eb8307fc613e941bc81127f794db13e6.mp4?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>- Choose which cards to play!</strong>- <br>Defeat the mafia by choosing the cards in your deck, you must be careful: not all cards bring positive results<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/392b2abfdfa9c647633a3031b59389c8.poster.avif?t=1675241551\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/392b2abfdfa9c647633a3031b59389c8.webm?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/392b2abfdfa9c647633a3031b59389c8.mp4?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>- Sensational visual effects </strong><br>Every time you play your card, you activate its effect: energy bombs, storms, music and much more...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/697858a317556bf6ea838b6368c6e84e.poster.avif?t=1675241551\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/697858a317556bf6ea838b6368c6e84e.webm?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278600/extras/697858a317556bf6ea838b6368c6e84e.mp4?t=1675241551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
